# Explicit 301 Permanent redirects from legacy .html URLs to the canonical
# extension-less paths. Cloudflare Workers Assets' default auto-stripping
# returns 307 Temporary, which Search Console flags as "Page with redirect"
# and which doesn't pass full canonical PageRank. _redirects rules are
# evaluated before auto-handling so these 301s override the 307s. The
# reverse direction (/weather → /weather.html) is still handled by the
# default html_handling, so extension-less URLs serve content without a
# redirect.

/index.html       /          301
/weather.html     /weather   301
/stocks.html      /stocks    301
/settings.html    /settings  301
/privacy.html     /privacy   301
/terms.html       /terms     301
/sources.html     /sources   301
